---
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="head">
    <h2 class="title sc-reveal">Supported Stacks &amp; Runtimes</h2>
    <p class="subtitle sc-reveal">Spryteo runs where you run. One core Rust engine, wrapped for the surfaces you already use.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="bento-grid">
    <a href="/docs#library" class="bento-card sc-reveal">
      <div class="bento-icon">JS</div>
      <div class="bento-content">
        <h3 class="bento-title">Node.js &amp; npm</h3>
        <p class="bento-desc">Native napi-rs bindings. Run the engine in-process with zero subprocess overhead.</p>
        <code class="bento-snippet">import &#123; convert &#125; from 'spryteo'</code>
      </div>
    </a>
    
    <a href="/docs#cli" class="bento-card sc-reveal">
      <div class="bento-icon">CLI</div>
      <div class="bento-content">
        <h3 class="bento-title">Command Line</h3>
        <p class="bento-desc">A fast, standalone binary for your terminal, bash scripts, and CI pipelines.</p>
        <code class="bento-snippet">$ spryteo in.png --out out.svg</code>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="/docs#browser" class="bento-card sc-reveal">
      <div class="bento-icon">WASM</div>
      <div class="bento-content">
        <h3 class="bento-title">Browser Runtime</h3>
        <p class="bento-desc">The engine compiled to WebAssembly. Convert images client-side without a server round-trip.</p>
        <code class="bento-snippet">convert_default(bytes)</code>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="/docs#mcp" class="bento-card sc-reveal">
      <div class="bento-icon">MCP</div>
      <div class="bento-content">
        <h3 class="bento-title">AI Agents (MCP)</h3>
        <p class="bento-desc">Expose Spryteo to Claude or other MCP clients to generate SVGs mid-conversation.</p>
        <code class="bento-snippet">&#123; "command": "spryteo-mcp" &#125;</code>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="https://github.com/chidi09/spryteo" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bento-card sc-reveal">
      <div class="bento-icon">RS</div>
      <div class="bento-content">
        <h3 class="bento-title">Rust Crates</h3>
        <p class="bento-desc">Embed the core engine directly in Rust. (v0.0.1 pre-release source, coming to crates.io)</p>
        <code class="bento-snippet">spryteo = "0.0.1"</code>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="section-footer sc-reveal">
    <a href="/docs" class="section-docs-link">explore the API in the docs &#8594;</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 96px 32px;
  }
  .head {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 0 48px;
  }
  .title {
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .bento-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    grid-auto-rows: minmax(220px, auto);
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .bento-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 28px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text);
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-bounce), box-shadow var(--transition-fast);
  }
  .bento-card:nth-child(1), .bento-card:nth-child(2) {
    grid-column: span 2;
  }
  @media (min-width: 901px) {
    .bento-card:nth-child(1) { grid-column: span 2; }
    .bento-card:nth-child(2) { grid-column: span 1; }
    .bento-card:nth-child(3) { grid-column: span 1; }
    .bento-card:nth-child(4) { grid-column: span 1; }
    .bento-card:nth-child(5) { grid-column: span 1; }
  }
  .bento-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }
  .bento-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    background: rgba(198, 255, 75, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(198, 255, 75, 0.2);
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .bento-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .bento-title {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .bento-desc {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .bento-snippet {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text);
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 10px 14px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    white-space: pre;
  }
  .section-footer {
    display: flex;
  }
  .section-docs-link {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }
  .section-docs-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .bento-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
    .bento-card:nth-child(1), .bento-card:nth-child(2), .bento-card:nth-child(3), .bento-card:nth-child(4), .bento-card:nth-child(5) {
      grid-column: span 1;
    }
    .bento-card:nth-child(5) {
      grid-column: span 2;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .section {
      padding: 64px 20px;
    }
    .title {
      font-size: 28px;
    }
    .bento-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .bento-card:nth-child(n) {
      grid-column: span 1;
    }
  }
</style>
